al Data.</h2>\n                        <span class=\"text-xs font-medium text-stone-400 mt-2 mask-reveal-back\">Inside</span>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-6 h-full\">\n\n                        <!-- Nutrition Table Container -->\n                        <div class=\"flex-1 bg-stone-50 border-2 border-stone-900 p-2 text-stone-900 shadow-sm\">\n                            <h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold tracking-tight border-b-[6px] border-stone-900 pb-1 mb-1 mask-reveal-back\">Nutrition Facts</h3>\n                            <div class=\"text-xs border-b border-stone-900 pb-1 flex justify-between mask-reveal-back\"><span>1 application per container</span></div>\n                            <div class=\"text-xs font-bold flex justify-between items-end border-b-[4px] border-stone-900 py-1 mb-1\">\n                                <span class=\"mask-reveal-back\">Amount per serving</span>\n                                <span class=\"text-2xl leading-none mask-reveal-back\">0</span>\n                            </div>\n\n                            <div class=\"flex justify-between border-b border-stone-400 py-1 text-xs\">\n                                <span class=\"font-bold\">Total Fat <span class=\"font-normal\">0g</span></span> <span class=\"font-bold\">0%</span>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"flex justify-between border-b border-stone-400 py-1 pl-3 text-xs\">\n                                <span>Saturated Fat 0g</span> <span>0%</span>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"flex justify-between border-b border-stone-400 py-1 text-xs\">\n                                <span class=\"font-bold\">Sodium <span class=\"font-normal\">0mg</span></span> <span class=\"font-bold\">0%</span>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"flex justify-between border-b border-stone-400 py-1 text-